message: "If you use this software, please cite the article it accompanies."
title: "analysis-scale-trials: code, manifests and derived results for the analysis-scale reanalysis"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline, per-trial manifests, ledgers, simulation and derived
  results for a study of the analysis scale as an attribute of the
  treatment-effect estimand: the covariate-specific ROC curve of treated against
  control outcomes is exactly invariant to strictly increasing transformations
  while a mean-based summary is not, and the repository rebuilds a comparative
  reanalysis of 312 post-randomization comparisons from 20 randomized trials
  with 406 pre-randomization negative controls, a simulation grid, a
  severity-stratified duloxetine case study and a census of 41,245 registered
  trials. Contains no participant-level data: results/ holds one row per arm
  comparison, because two of the three trial sources are held under data use
  agreements that permit publication of aggregate results only.
